flowchart TD

A[-A- Start getNextItem] --> B[-B- Load all items]

B --> C[-C- Choose direction:
if mssf < mssr then forward else reverse]

C --> D[-D- Build overdue list:
now >= ts + interval]

D --> E{-E- Overdue exists?}

E -->|Yes| F[-F- Select weakest:
1 MSS
2 interval
3 random]

F --> Z[-Z- Return item]

E -->|No| H[-H- Build soon list:
next in 3 to 5 days]

H --> I{-I- Soon exists?}

I -->|Yes| J[-J- Select weakest]

J --> Z

I -->|No| L[-L- Build maintenance:
MSS > 80]

L --> M{-M- Exists?}

M -->|Yes| N[-N- Random maintenance]

N --> Z

M -->|No| O[-O- Build new list]

O --> P{-P- Exists?}

P -->|Yes| Q[-Q- Random new]

Q --> Z

P -->|No| R[-R- Random fallback]

R --> Z